onZh":"如此","glossesEn":["to such a degree, extent"],"examples":[{"english":"don't talk so fast!","chinese":"别说得那么快！"},{"english":"there's no need to worry so","chinese":"没必要这么着急"},{"english":"it’s not so easy as you’d think","chinese":"这并非你想象的那么容易"}]},{"id":"so:o:c4f67b3b0aaa","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"非常","glossesEn":["very"],"examples":[{"english":"I'm so glad you're here","chinese":"你来这儿我非常高兴"},{"english":"he sat there ever so quietly","chinese":"他静悄悄地坐在那儿"},{"english":"she loved him so","chinese":"她非常爱他"}]},{"id":"so:o:48b8631d5204","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"这么","glossesEn":["demonstrating size, technique"],"examples":[{"english":"she's about so tall","chinese":"她差不多有这么高"},{"english":"stand with your arms out, so","chinese":"两臂伸开站着，这样"},{"english":"it fastens (like) so","chinese":"是这样系的"}]},{"id":"so:o:08945af11b86","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"是这样","glossesEn":["that is the case, the truth"],"examples":[{"english":"he said so","chinese":"他这样说过的"},{"english":"if so","chinese":"要是那样"},{"english":"I'm afraid so","chinese":"恐怕是这样"}]},{"id":"so:o:5aa3fc5ec48a","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"指以前提到的事物","glossesEn":["this"],"examples":[{"english":"so saying …","chinese":"如此说…"},{"english":"they asked me to call them, and I did so","chinese":"他们要我给他们打电话，于是我就打了"},{"english":"it is a secret, and will remain so","chinese":"这是秘密，将来也仍然如此"}]},{"id":"so:o:170b52376e71","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"也","glossesEn":["also"],"examples":[{"english":"he's French, and so is she","chinese":"他是法国人，她也是"},{"english":"if they accept, so do I","chinese":"如果他们答应，我也答应"}]},{"id":"so:o:56d6a3db96ee","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"的确如此","glossesEn":["expressing agreement"],"examples":[{"english":"there’s another one — so there is","chinese":"还有一个──可不是嘛"},{"english":"I thought you liked it? — so I do","chinese":"我以为你是喜欢它的？──当然啰"}]},{"id":"so:o:808f362be9d2","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"像这样","glossesEn":["in such a way"],"examples":[{"english":"so it was that he finally returned home","chinese":"就这样，他终于回到了家"},{"english":"the contract is so worded that ownership is unclear","chinese":"合同这样措词使得所有权不明确"},{"english":"so to speak","chinese":"可以说"}]},{"id":"so:o:5a885135c785","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"所以","glossesEn":["for that reason"],"examples":[{"english":"he's young, and so impulsive","chinese":"他年轻，所以容易冲动"},{"english":"she was tired and so went to bed","chinese":"她累了，于是上床睡觉去了"}]},{"id":"so:o:472150512f05","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"大约","glossesEn":["thereabouts"],"examples":[{"english":"there were twenty or so people there","chinese":"那儿有20人左右"},{"english":"a year or so ago","chinese":"大约1年前"}]},{"id":"so:o:d99978d1aed7","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"的确","glossesEn":["definitely"],"registers":["informal"],"examples":[{"english":"that's so not fair","chinese":"那确实不公平"},{"english":"you are so going to regret this","chinese":"你肯定会为此后悔的"}]},{"id":"so:o:e634fea22e48","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"偏就是","glossesEn":["contradicting a statement"],"registers":["informal"],"examples":[{"english":"he didn't hit you — he did so!","chinese":"他没有打你──他就是打了的！"}]},{"id":"so:o:9d3e7b59f88a","label":"conj.","definitionZh":"为了","glossesEn":["in order that"],"examples":[{"english":"but I gave you a map so you wouldn’t get lost!","chinese":"但我怕你迷路，给过你一张地图！"}]},{"id":"so:o:cb3c2f7a9a6f","label":"conj.","definitionZh":"就这样","glossesEn":["introducing next part of narrative"],"examples":[{"english":"so after shouting and screaming for an hour, she walked out in tears","chinese":"就这样，大喊大叫了1个小时后，她泪流满面走了出来"}]},{"id":"so:o:5b457e79ef7c","label":"conj.","definitionZh":"因此","glossesEn":["and therefore, with the result that"],"examples":[{"english":"it's Sunday, so the shops are shut","chinese":"今天是星期天，所以商店都不开门"},{"english":"so there!","chinese":"就是这样！"},{"english":"well, you can’t have it, so there!","chinese":"好啦，就是不给你，没什么好说的！"}]},{"id":"so:o:e9b17ec3b95a","label":"conj.","definitionZh":"那又怎样","glossesEn":["defending self, dismissing sth"],"registers":["informal"],"examples":[{"english":"so I had a couple of drinks on the way home: what’s wrong with that?","chinese":"不错，我在回家的路上是喝了两杯：这有什么不对吗？"},{"english":"you’ve been smoking again — so?","chinese":"你又抽烟了──那又怎样？"},{"english":"I'm leaving — so?","chinese":"我要走了──那又怎样？"}]},{"id":"so:o:63014dd20b6a","label":"conj.","definitionZh":"那么","glossesEn":["introductory or ensuing or concluding remark"],"examples":[{"english":"so, what have you been doing today?","chinese":"那你今天都干什么了？"},{"english":"so you're going, are you?","chinese":"这么说，你要走了，是吗？"},{"english":"so, that’s it for today","chinese":"好，今天就到这里"}]},{"id":"so:o:7d8107a152f6","label":"conj.","definitionZh":"同样","glossesEn":["in the same way"],"examples":[{"english":"as prices go up, so sales decline","chinese":"物价在上涨，销售额则在下降"},{"english":"just as you need him, so he needs you","chinese":"正如你需要他一样，他也需要你"}]},{"id":"so:o:0d18d6cd883d","label":"conj.","definitionZh":"然后","glossesEn":["next"],"examples":[{"english":"and so to the final","chinese":"然后进入决赛"}]},{"id":"so:o:a0393145870b","label":"conj. phr.","definitionZh":"以便","examples":[{"english":"she wrote the instructions so that they'd be easily understood","chinese":"她写了用法说明以使其易于理解"},{"english":"she fixed the party for 8 so that he could come","chinese":"她把聚会时间定在8点为的是他能来"}]},{"id":"so:o:fb489b165aee","label":"conj. phr.","definitionZh":"为了","examples":[{"english":"he tiptoed out, so as not to disturb people","chinese":"为了不惊动别人，他踮着脚走了出去"}]},{"id":"so:o:a687494c3582","label":"phr.","definitionZh":"这么多","glossesEn":["a certain number, such a large number"],"examples":[{"english":"the hostel can only take so many","chinese":"这家招待所只能接待这么多人"},{"english":"there are only so many hours in a day","chinese":"一天就只有这么多个小时"},{"english":"I've warned him about it so many times","chinese":"这事我已经提醒他好多次了"}]},{"id":"so:o:0e786b800527","label":"phr.","definitionZh":"表示对应或等同","glossesEn":["in comparisons"],"examples":[{"english":"they were behaving like so many schoolgirls","chinese":"他们的表现跟那些学校的小女生